  "note": "A2 lisc · second technology pack, sitting on a1_tech. NOTHING a1_tech already owns is re-taught here: komputer, laptop, telefon, komorka, ekran, aplikacja, internet, e-mail, blog, wiadomosc, wiadomosci, strona internetowa, zdjecie, obrazek, aparat, telewizor, telewizja, radio, wideo, gazeta, czasopismo, online are all ANCHORS and appear only in uses_lemmas. 13 new items: 10 nouns + 3 verbs. STRONA — checked against POOL and the bare noun 'strona' IS already taught (alongside 'strona internetowa'), so it is recycled, not taught. HASLO — checked and genuinely absent from POOL, so it is taught here. MYSZKA — 'mysz' is already taught as the animal; 'myszka' is a separate item and carries the sense-indicator 'mouse (computer, not the animal)' so the two never collide. All three verbs land in conjugation classes that are already taught: dzwonic -> dzwonie/dzwonisz (present_e_isz), wysylac -> wysylam/wysylasz (present_am), ladowac -> laduje/ladujesz (present_uje). No new verb pattern. Imperfective only, present tense only — no past forms of the new verbs, so a2_aspect ground is untouched. Every sentence carries exactly one unknown. Feminine adjective check: 'mala' is NOT in POOL (only maly/male), so myszka takes a place phrase instead of an adjective. This pack feeds a2_phone_func immediately after it in path_order — dzwonie, wysylam, laduje and numer are all used there.",
